during the three months ended January 31, 2023, was $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromExerciseOfOptions" scale="0" unitRef="cad">132,338</ix:nonFraction> (2022 - $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c3" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromExerciseOfOptions" scale="0" unitRef="cad">218,974</ix:nonFraction>) which was recorded as share-based payment reserve and charged
to operations. The weighted average fair value of stock options granted during the three months ended January 31, 2023 was $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="cmnd:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAveragePricePerShar" scale="0" unitRef="cadPershares">3.02</ix:nonFraction> per share
(no options were granted during the three months ended January 31, 2023).</p></ix:continuation><div>

