</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>CLEARMIND MEDICINE INC.&#160;</b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Notes to the Condensed Interim Consolidated Financial Statements&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">(Expressed in Canadian Dollars)</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">(Unaudited)</p><div>

